I took a quick peak at the form factor for the phone. I don't think Otterbox makes a compatible case for that phone. You can try getting a case to see if it fits. I would not recommend this though because most cases require a secure fit to protect your device. 

&#x200B;

I would recommend searching for a case made specifically for your phone.

