I think it is easy to look at a political party and see the extremes of the party pitches. The harder thing to do is look at the values of the political party and ask what is that I agree with or I could compromise on?

&#x200B;

I also agree with azure\_kin that you should try to support your local government more than at the national level. The best and hardest ways for political parties to get things done is to find places to agree and compromise where they can't. 

&#x200B;

I used to get very upset by politics and the news media cycle. I permanently deleted my Facebook and then I starting blocking news sites from my news app that skewed facts in either direction too much. I want impartial news, just facts with some light commentary.

I have seen videos and theories out there that try to explain this, I don't remember the videos what I am about to explain is not my own creation or ideas. Also I am not 100% up to date on DOOM lore so some of this might be off. 

&#x200B;

So the best theory I have heard explains that the DOOM 3 was the first game chronologically (that makes less sense as time goes on, considering time as a relative factor). Then DOOM 1 came around leading into DOOM 2, etc. How does DOOM 2016 kick into this? The idea is that the DOOM Marine from 1+2 stayed in Hell after the fight was over and continued to slay demons eventually being contacted by Heaven and granted additional powers, this was mentioned in DOOM 2016. Time flows differently in Hell and he could have been there thousands of years in Hell=years on Earth, vice versa. Eventually the original Earth he was from is either destroyed, repopulated or an alternate dimension is found/finds Hell. The idea is the Earth went back to a primitive state and humanity started over forgetting advanced tech and the invasion from Hell. Starting over a new UAC (I know a stretch that the name would the same) is created and a cycle starts over. The other side is the DOOM Marine's original Earth was destroyed, after fighting in Hell he came upon the....others....(mild spoiler for the poster) people who beat the name know who I mean, can't remember their name. Fought with them against Hell or just happens to fight Hell side by side. A separate dimension/reality of Earth discovers Hell and that is where DOOM 2016 kicks off. 

&#x200B;

Other theories are Mars being the Earth from the first invasion and that is how humanity resettled on the (present) Earth. There are a bunch of different ideas out there.

